# File: deploy/.gitignore
# Purpose: keep run output and real configuration out of git. Real env files and secrets live
#   in /etc/live-commerce (outside the checkout); these patterns catch accidental local copies.
# Runs as/in: git on developer/deploy hosts. Reads env / secrets: none.
# Used by: git; smoke S06 asserts these patterns exist.
# Status: DESIGN. Change rules: never un-ignore env/*.env or .evidence/ (smoke logs are
#   secret-scanned but may contain host details).

# smoke / deploy evidence (integrator copies selected runs to evidence/release/, I6)
.evidence/

# local overrides and copies of real configuration
*.local.*
env/*.env
!env/*.env.example
secrets/
